{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqojzvvx8vf","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"Retrieval gap study points to eval snapshot mismatch before MiniLM","summary":"The controlled retrieval embedding study for codex/retrieval-embedding-study did not isolate MiniLM as the dominant cause of poor end-to-end memory results. Checked-in retrieval scorecards are high, but current rerank-off reruns with semantic warmup score zero positives, which is more consistent with eval/snapshot/title-key or corpus drift than embedding quality alone. Next retrieval work should first make the isolated held-out benchmark self-contained and diagnostic, then run true re-embed A/Bs for MiniLM, local instruct, and hosted providers only with explicit opt-in.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-22T01:45:26.061Z","vec":[0.012235782109200954,-0.01859542541205883,-0.014679079875349998,0.03665681928396225,0.0647478774189949,0.017474770545959473,-0.05658729746937752,0.02723131701350212,0.04358101263642311,-0.03453431650996208,0.029923100024461746,0.04934820532798767,0.03183593600988388,0.01422025728970766,-0.0833713561296463,-0.0308276005089283,0.07809021323919296,0.04981620982289314,-0.018121931701898575,0.011447802186012268,-0.08298613876104355,0.015163886360824108,0.00657036155462265,-0.030334973707795143,0.021997744217514992,-0.0015758873196318746,-0.14280149340629578,0.011603743769228458,0.06746087968349457,-0.05392097309231758,0.061692673712968826,0.06074436008930206,-0.036997612565755844,0.057992253452539444,0.07499472051858902,0.10059854388237,-0.04983258992433548,-0.01519364956766367,-0.04751071333885193,-0.036016181111335754,-0.0035660022404044867,0.022693539038300514,-0.046719156205654144,0.04316253587603569,-0.0027292827144265175,-0.0487331859767437,-0.021601369604468346,-0.034534648060798645,-0.05738447606563568,-0.024515999481081963,-0.10388677567243576,0.038675520569086075,-0.06463084369897842,0.0436318963766098,-0.03564818948507309,0.013922959566116333,-0.0164575576